The Supernote .note format was documented from sample files and public
community research, see docs/note-format.md. The .note parser in
crates/notedown-note is a clean-room implementation of that document.
The source code in this repository includes no third-party code.

The binary releases do include third-party code. Every release has Rust
crates. The macOS builds also have llama.cpp and the code it bundles. The
app also has JavaScript and CSS packages for its window. Each release ships
a THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.txt file that lists this code and its licenses.
